diagnostic_evidence.quote:
In total, for every $f\in H$, with probability at least $1 - 2d \exp\left(-\frac{m\veps^2}{2\|k\|_\infty}\right)$, we obtain
\begin{align*}
\|(\wh\calK^{\mathrm{MC}} - \wh\calK)f\|_\infty\,\le\,\veps\cdot\|k\|_\infty^{1/2}\cdot\big(\max_{v\in\one}v^\top \mathbf{K}_\calX^{-1}v\big)^{1/2}\|f\|_H,
\end{align*}
i.e., \eqref{eq:MC_error}.

Then, for every $\veps > 0$ and  for all $f \in \bH$, $\| f \|_\bH \leq 1$, we have the pointwise error bound
    \begin{equation}\label{eq:total_err}
            \| (\calK - \widehat{\calK}^{\mathrm{MC}}) f\|_{\infty} \leq \big[ 1 + \|\calK\|_{\bH\to \bH} \big] \|\calI - S_\calX \|_{\bH \to C_b} + \veps \cdot \|k\|_\infty^{1/2} \sqrt{\max_{v\in\one}v^\top \mathbf{K}_\calX^{-1}v} 
    \storeEquationInTheorem{eq:total_err}
    \end{equation}
    with probability at least $1 - 2d \exp\left(-\frac{m\veps^2}{2\|k\|_\infty}\right)$.

